Signed-off-by: Jian Hu <jian.hu@amlogic.com>
Reviewed-by: Conor Dooley <conor.dooley@microchip.com>
---
 .../bindings/clock/amlogic,t7-pll-clkc.yaml   | 114 ++++++++++++++++++
